<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44210" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Signĭa</span></b> , ae,
		f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an
				ancient town in Latium which produced an astringent wine</i>,
			now <i>Segni</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 1,
			56</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 21</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>; 8, 3; 32, 2; <i><span class="en">Plin. 14,
			6</span></i>. 8, § 65; <i><span class="en">Sil. 8, 380</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Signīnus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Signia</i>, <i>Signian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 4,
					5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 19</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 13, 116</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pira,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 10, 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 15, 16, § 55</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 11,
				73 al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opus,</span>”
				<i>a kind of plaster for walls and pavements</i>,
						<i>made of potsherds and lime</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2,
					4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 1, 6,
				12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 15,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 17,
			1</span></i>.—As <i>subst.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Signīnum</span></b> ,
			i, n., = Signinum opus, <i><span class="en">Col. 9, 1,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 35, 12, 46, §
			165</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Signīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Signia</i>, <i>Signians</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Liv.
				27, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, §
		64</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
